id: GUIDE7-1
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: hint_instance_key
target: crates/core/src/hint_open.rs
find:     let key = current.clone();
replace:     let key = StepUid(format!("main/{}", current.0.rsplit('/').next().unwrap_or_default()));
expect-fail: opening_in_one_root_does_not_touch_another
expect-fail: property_counts_follow_the_step_instance
note: 鍵から根を落とし、周回（実体）の間でヒントの使用回数が混ざる
